  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Nigeria&#x2019;s Border Management Capabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project targets strengthening the Federal Government of Nigeria&apos;s capacity to effectively and securely manage its borders by facilitating regular movement and simultaneously preventing irregular ones by implementing required technical tools and legal procedures, and operational protocols.</narrative>
